ControllerAggregate --> RuntimeHandler : Uses
ControllerAggregate --> ErrorHandler : Uses
InitHandler ..> Event : Subscribes
RuntimeHandler ..> Event : Subscribes
ErrorHandler ..> Event : Subscribes

AudioProcessorAggregate --> AudioSource : Uses
AudioProcessorAggregate --> AudioTransform : Uses
AudioSource --> Audio : Captures
AudioTransform --> Audio : Transforms
